                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "1 Mayfair is a high-end residential building in London’s Mayfair district, comprising 29 luxury apartments arranged over a garden level, ground floor, seven upper storeys, and five basement levels. The lower floors accommodate extensive amenities including a gym, swimming pool, spa, and private parking, while the upper levels contain private residences with access to landscaped terraces and a central courtyard. The structure is designed with traditional stone façades and finely detailed elevations that reflect the architectural character of its historic surroundings, integrating modern construction methods with classical proportions and craftsmanship."
