      "body": "XIX-century tenement house located between two higher buildings.\n\nLocating the addition on the flat roof of the building, in order to create a common space for the residents.\n\nAdapting the shape to neighbours roofs. Obtaining a smooth transition between neighbours roofs.\n\nCreation of a truss structure, that allows illumination of the common space.\n\nLocalization of the winter garden from the south and open space from the north with ivy growing on the steel net attached to the superstructure.",
