      "body": "\r\nI enjoy working with my hands, particularly with timber, restoring architectural elements, and creating things from scratch. It's a rewarding way to unwind after a day at the computer. I love taking part in workshops, helping family and friends with their projects, and making things myself, like a wooden gong stand I recently built.\r\n",
